    {
      "id": "u1-theory-4",
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "L'alphabet français (Французский алфавит)",
      "content": "<p style='margin-bottom:1rem'>Французский алфавит содержит <strong>26 букв</strong>. Ниже — произношение каждой буквы с подсказками на русском.</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Буква</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Произношение</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Буква</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Произношение</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>A a</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[а]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>N n</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[эн]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>B b</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[бэ]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>O o</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[о]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>C c</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[сэ]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>P p</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[пэ]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>D d</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[дэ]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>Q q</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[кю]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>E e</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[э/ё]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>R r</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[эр] (горловой)</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>F f</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[эф]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>S s</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[эс]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>G g</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[жэ]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>T t</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[тэ]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>H h</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[аш] (не читается!)</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>U u</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[ю] (губы трубочкой)</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>I i</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[и]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>V v</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[вэ]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>J j</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[жи]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>W w</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[дублевэ]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>K k</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[ка]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>X x</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[икс]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>L l</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[эль]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>Y y</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[игрек]</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>M m</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[эм]</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>Z z</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>[зэд]</td></tr></table><p style='padding:1rem;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border-radius:8px'>💡 <strong>Акценты (ударения):</strong> é [э закрытый], è/ê [э открытый], â [а долгий], ç [с], ô [о долгий], ù [ю]</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "u1-theory-5",
      "type": "theory",
